// N27-AB — Pacto de la Espada, tier 4: "Hoja Coronada" / "Crowned Blade".
// Unlocked by spending the tier-4 point on `PactBladeSkill::Crown`
// (`Simple(Some(PactBlade(Crown)), ..)` in the manifest). Tier 4 is 175,000
// blade XP -- near-total investment -- so this is the strongest of the three
// by a clear margin, and priced to match: the longest windup in the set, the
// highest energy cost, and a 32 s cooldown -- `game-balance-designer`
// compared this against every shipped class capstone (45-60 s) and flagged
// an initial 24 s as an outlier giving ~83% curse uptime on a priority
// target; 32 s brings uptime down to the ~60% band those capstones sit in
// without touching the damage or curse numbers, which independently checked
// out fine against their own precedents (see below).
//
// A single committed thrust, not a sweep: the crowned blade picks one thing
// and finishes it. `Stab` (DamageKind::Piercing, hardcoded in
// common/src/comp/melee.rs) at a longer reach than either sibling.
//
// The `Cursed` rider is the crown itself -- what the blade takes, it keeps.
// `Cursed` drags the victim's MAXIMUM health down toward `1.0 - strength`
// while it lasts (see BuffKind::Cursed in common/src/comp/buff.rs), so
// `Value(0.15)` is a 15% max-health bite for 20 s, well under the shipped
// `bestow_curse` spell's `Value(0.3)` for 60 s. Guaranteed rather than
// chanced, because this is a capstone on a long cooldown, not a rider on a
// spammable strike.
//
// Damage sits just above the level-5 spell band (destructive_wave 78) --
// appropriate for a capstone gated behind an entire boon's XP ladder rather
// than a class level, and the only thing in this set that is meant to compete
// with a big spell. See pact_blade_mute.ron for why `source: Some(Arcane)` is
// load-bearing and why `school` is unset.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 45,
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    swing_duration: 0.12,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.6,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Stab(
            damage: 68,
            poise: 32,
            knockback: 10,
            energy_regen: 0,
        ),
        range: 4.0,
        angle: 20.0,
        damage_effect: Some(Buff((
            kind: Cursed,
            dur_secs: 20.0,
            strength: Value(0.15),
            chance: 1.0,
        ))),
    ),
    meta: (
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(32.0),
    ),
)
